</span><span begin="01:17.000" end="01:17.330">one </span><span begin="01:17.330" end="01:17.570">that </span><span begin="01:17.570" end="01:17.930">always </span><span begin="01:17.930" end="01:18.470">turns </span><span begin="01:18.470" end="01:18.740">me </span><span begin="01:18.740" end="01:19.190">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.190" end="01:21.800"><span begin="01:19.190" end="01:19.310">You </span><span begin="01:19.310" end="01:20.060">keep </span><span begin="01:20.060" end="01:20.240">mein' </span><span begin="01:20.240" end="01:21.800">'round</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.050" end="01:26.930"><span begin="01:24.050" end="01:25.040">I </span><span begin="01:25.040" end="01:25.400">know </span><span begin="01:25.400" end="01:25.490">her </span><span begin="01:25.490" end="01:26.060">love </span><span begin="01:26.060" end="01:26.210">is </span><span begin="01:26.210" end="01:26.930">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.960" end="01:31.340"><span begin="01:26.960" end="01:27.260">But </span><span begin="01:27.260" end="01:27.350">it's </span><span begin="01:27.350" end="01:27.890">so </span><span begin="01:27.890" end="01:28.430">damn </span><span begin="01:28.430" end="01:28.850">easy </span><span begin="01:28.850" end="01:29.300">makin' </span><span begin="01:29.300" end="01:29.810">love </span><span begin="01:29.810" end="01:29.960">to </span><span begin="01:29.960" end="01:31.340">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.360" end="01:35.120"><span begin="01:32.360" end="01:32.630">I </span><span begin="01:32.630" end="01:32.900">got </span><span begin="01:32.900" end="01:33.050">my </span><span begin="01:33.050" end="01:33.590">mind </span><span begin="01:33.590" end="01:33.950">made </span><span begin="01:33.950" end="01:35.120">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.170" end="01:38.060"><span begin="01:36.170" end="01:36.410">I </span><span begin="01:36.410" end="01:36.710">need </span><span begin="01:36.710"